From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "v.oleynikov" <vasily.oleynikov@flant.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 08:15:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add volume cleanup and the feature package

Wipe the volume data with the method from the volumeCleanup secret key before the subdirectory is removed in DeleteVolume and DeleteSnapshot. The cleanup itself is EE-only and gated by github.com/deckhouse/csi-nfs/lib/go/common/pkg/feature. Ported onto v4.13.4.

Signed-off-by: v.oleynikov <vasily.oleynikov@flant.com>
